          <attvalue for="28" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="An increase in net available oil and refined‑fuel supply reduces crude-price spikes and input‑cost uncertainty, directly calming trading in Brazilian equities, bonds and FX and thus lowering short‑term market volatility." />
