          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Spikes in Brazilian market volatility make governance and accounting issues in foreign-listed or China-linked tech firms with Brazilian operations more visible, prompting US and allied regulators to open investigations and accelerate rule‑making focused on cross‑border AI and data activities." />
