          <attvalue for="34" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A sharp increase in capital leaving Brazil forces cross‑border sales of emerging‑market bonds and equities, increasing supply and perceived tail‑risk and thereby raising risk premia demanded by global investors for risky assets." />
