          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Sustained capital flight from Brazil reduces upstream investment and maintenance in domestic oil projects (including Petrobras-led capacity), lowering Brazilian crude and refined‑fuel output and tightening the contemporaneous global energy supply balance." />
